ads the travellers along the boiling blood, naming tyrants at different depths."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-12-4-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-12-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-phlegethon","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":52.01,"statusNotes":"Sees souls immersed according to the blood they shed."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-12-4-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-12-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-phlegethon","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":52.02,"statusNotes":"Lets Nessus instruct Dante while they seek a ford."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-12-5-nessus","characterId":"inferno-char-nessus","eventId":"inferno-event-12-5","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-phlegethon","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":53,"statusNotes":"Carries Dante through the shallow passage, points to deeper tyrants, and returns alone."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-12-5-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-12-5","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-phlegethon","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":53.01,"statusNotes":"Crosses to the inner bank under the centaur’s protection."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-12-5-virgil","characterId":"inferno-ch