ying, crouching, or wandering under a slow rain of fire."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-14-2-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-14-2","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-burning-sand","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":60.01,"statusNotes":"Identifies the three postures while keeping to the forest edge."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-14-3-capaneus","characterId":"inferno-char-capaneus","eventId":"inferno-event-14-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-burning-sand","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":61,"statusNotes":"Lies huge upon the sand and defies Jupiter without softening his pride."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-14-3-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-14-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-burning-sand","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":61.01,"statusNotes":"Rebukes the blasphemer and says his unquenched arrogance completes the punishment."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-14-3-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-14-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-burning-sand","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-lower","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":61.02,"statusNotes":"Hears the ancient war at Thebes recalled through Capaneus’s boast."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-14-4-virgil