ntify himself and his offence."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-18-3-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-18-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-bolgia-one","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-malebolge","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":83.02,"statusNotes":"Calls Dante onward once the confession is made."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-18-4-jason","characterId":"inferno-char-jason","eventId":"inferno-event-18-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-bolgia-one","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-malebolge","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":84,"statusNotes":"Walks with royal bearing despite the lashes, bearing punishment for two betrayals."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-18-4-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-18-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-bolgia-one","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-malebolge","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":84.01,"statusNotes":"Names the Greek hero and recounts the women abandoned by his eloquence."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-18-4-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-18-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-bolgia-one","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-malebolge","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":84.02,"statusNotes":"Studies the dignified face within the degrading procession."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-18-5-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"