Leads Dante onward across Antenora after the condemnation of Pisa."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-33-8-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-33-8","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-ptolomaea","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":188,"statusNotes":"Finds shades lying face upward while frozen tears seal their eyes."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-33-8-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-33-8","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-ptolomaea","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":188.01,"statusNotes":"Crosses the hard crust toward the final zone."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-33-9-alberigo","characterId":"inferno-char-alberigo","eventId":"inferno-event-33-9","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-ptolomaea","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":189,"statusNotes":"Asks Dante to clear the ice from his eyes and explains that some traitors fall here before bodily death."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-33-9-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-33-9","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-ptolomaea","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":189.01,"statusNotes":"Promises relief in exchange for the truth, then refuses it after hearing the betrayal."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-33-9-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-33-9","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-ptolomaea","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":189.02,"statusNotes":"Waits while the living traveller learns the strange law."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-1-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-34-1","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":190,"statusNotes":"Announces the approach to Lucifer and places Dante where the shape can emerge through the gloom."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-1-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-34-1","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":190.01,"statusNotes":"Sees souls wholly sealed in the transparent ice of Judecca."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-2-lucifer","characterId":"inferno-char-lucifer","eventId":"inferno-event-34-2","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":191,"statusNotes":"Rises from the ice with three faces, six batlike wings, and three sinners crushed in his mouths."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-2-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-34-2","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":191.01,"statusNotes":"Loses the ordinary sense of life and death before the ruined grandeur."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-2-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-34-2","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":191.02,"statusNotes":"Measures Lucifer against the giants and names the three greatest traitors."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-3-lucifer","characterId":"inferno-char-lucifer","eventId":"inferno-event-34-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":192,"statusNotes":"Weeps from six eyes while his wings freeze Cocytus and his mouths chew Judas, Brutus, and Cassius."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-3-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-34-3","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":192.01,"statusNotes":"Studies the colours and structure of the emperor of the dolorous realm."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-3-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-34-3","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":192.02,"statusNotes":"Explains each mouth’s prisoner and announces that night is returning."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-4-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-34-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":193,"statusNotes":"Identifies Judas head-first in the central mouth and the two Roman assassins in the black faces."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-4-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-34-4","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":193.01,"statusNotes":"Understands the last image of betrayal before the escape begins."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-4-lucifer","characterId":"inferno-char-lucifer","eventId":"inferno-event-34-4","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-judecca","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":193.02,"statusNotes":"Continues the mindless motion that makes the frozen wind."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-5-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-34-5","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-earth-centre","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":194,"statusNotes":"Clings to Lucifer’s shaggy side, times the wingbeats, and turns at the centre of gravity."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-5-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-34-5","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-earth-centre","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":194.01,"statusNotes":"Holds Virgil’s neck and is bewildered when descent becomes ascent."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-5-lucifer","characterId":"inferno-char-lucifer","eventId":"inferno-event-34-5","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-earth-centre","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":194.02,"statusNotes":"Serves unwittingly as the ladder out of Hell."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-6-dante","characterId":"inferno-char-dante","eventId":"inferno-event-34-6","isAlive":true,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-earth-centre","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":195,"statusNotes":"Looks back and sees Lucifer inverted, then asks how time, orientation, and ice have changed."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-6-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-34-6","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-earth-centre","currentMapLayerId":"inferno-map-cocytus","inventoryItemIds":[],"inventoryNotes":"","travelModeId":null,"sortKey":195.01,"statusNotes":"Sets Dante on the cavern floor and begins explaining the passage across the world’s centre."},{"worldId":"inferno-world","createdAt":1792281600000,"updatedAt":1792281600000,"id":"inferno-snapshot-34-7-virgil","characterId":"inferno-char-virgil","eventId":"inferno-event-34-7","isAlive":false,"currentLocationMarkerId":"inferno-loc-earth-centre","curre